        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Letters of reprimand that have expired may be used as a consideration when determining the penalty to be imposed in an adverse action when a range of penalties may be imposed. However, the expired LOR may not be used to constitute a prior offense.",
            "block_bbox": [
